<h1>Your Order Has Been Shipped!</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>Great news! Your order <strong>#{{orderNumber}}</strong> has been handed over to our shipping partner and is on its way to you.</p>

<div style="background-color: #FAFAFC; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
  <h4 style="margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #111827; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;">Delivery Details</h4>
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Courier Partner:</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0;">{{courier}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Tracking Number:</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; color: #082F5C;">{{trackingNumber}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-weight: 600;">Estimated Delivery:</td>
      <td align="right" style="padding: 6px 0; color: #16A34A; font-weight: 600;">{{estimatedDelivery}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

{{> button url=trackingUrl text="Track Shipment"}}

<p>You can follow the progress of your delivery in real-time by clicking the tracking button above. Please let us know if you need any assistance.</p>
<p>Thank you for shopping with {{platformName}}!<br><strong>The {{platformName}} Team</strong></p>
